  "caption": "For a week or more, an aparthotel can be easier than a classic room.\n\nYou get a kitchenette and more space, with hotel services like a reception and cleaning. Look for a washing machine so you can pack lighter, and check how often housekeeping comes and when the reception is open before you arrive.\n\nSave this for your next long trip.\n\n#travelhacks #longstay #traveltips",
